<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Rocket League – Advanced Mechanics</Major>
    <Description>This macro helps players master the half-flip technique and quick recovery in Rocket League. It automates the sequence of inputs needed to perform a perfect half-flip, followed by a powerslide to regain control. Ideal for improving movement efficiency during competitive play or training.</Description>
    <Comment>Great for practicing advanced mechanics without having to manually repeat the inputs. Perfect for players who want to improve their recoveries and rotations.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 22 1
Delay 50 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 50 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 100 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 300 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 150 ms
LeftUp 1
KeyDown 225 1
Delay 100 ms
KeyUp 225 1
KeyUp 20 1
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 150 ms
KeyUp 26 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rocket League</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>